  <!--EN: A weapon designed to give Warcaskets rapid ranged response in an urban environment, able to be collapsed for ease of storage and transportation. The mediocre damage and accuracy is an acceptable trade-off for this convenience, with an increase in rate of fire and minimal aiming to improve its ‘spray and pray’ functionality.-->
  <VFEP_Box_FoldingGun.description>一种为战棺设计的轻机枪。为了强化使用者在城市环境下的机动与反应能力，这种武器特地选择了便于存放与运输的折叠式结构。虽然其威力和精度为便携性做了一些让步，但更高的射速仍可以让使用者尽情地对敌人扫射。</VFEP_Box_FoldingGun.description>
